msgstr "すべてのショートカットを既定に戻しますか？"

msgid "Reset Shortcuts"
msgstr "ショートカットの初期化"

msgid "Tip: click in the key field and press the key combination you want."
msgstr "ヒント: キー入力欄をクリックして、割り当てたいキーの組み合わせを押してください。"

msgid "&Clear"
msgstr "割り当てを解除(&C)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the Sleep Timer dialog
msgid "Sleep Timer"
msgstr "スリープタイマー"

#. TRANSLATORS: Label for the input field where users enter the number of minutes for the sleep timer.
msgid "&Minutes:"
msgstr "分(&M):"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the Table of Contents dialog
msgid "Table of Contents"
msgstr "目次"

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message shown when the user attempts to confirm the Table of Contents dialog without having selected any section
msgid "Please select a section from the table of contents."
msgstr "目次からセクションを選択してください。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the error dialog shown when the user attempts to confirm the Table of Contents dialog without having selected any section
msgid "No Selection"
msgstr "選択なし"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the View Note dialog
msgid "View Note"
msgstr "メモの表示"

#. TRANSLATORS: Plural label for hours duration (e.g. "2 hours")
msgid "hours"
msgstr "時間"

#. TRANSLATORS: Plural label for minutes duration (e.g. "2 minutes")
msgid "minutes"
msgstr "分"

#. TRANSLATORS: Singular label for 1 second duration
msgid "1 second"
msgstr "1秒"

#. TRANSLATORS: Plural label for seconds duration (e.g. "2 seconds")
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒"

#. TRANSLATORS: Prompt showing estimated reading time. The {} placeholder is replaced with a formatted duration like "1 hour, 5 minutes".
msgid "Estimated reading time: {}"
msgstr "推定閲覧時間: {}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Message template for selection word count. The {} placeholder is replaced with the number of words.
msgid "The selection contains {} words."
msgstr "選択範囲の単語数は{}です。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Message template for document word count. The {} placeholder is replaced with the number of words.
msgid "This document contains {} words."
msgstr "この文書の単語数は{}です。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the Word Count dialog
msgid "Word Count"
msgstr "単語数"

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message shown when the requested document file does not exist; {} is the file path
msgid "File not found: {}"
msgstr "ファイルが見つかりません: {}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Prompt asking whether to import a document's previously saved settings and bookmarks found alongside it
msgid "A .paperback file was found for this document. Would you like to import it?"
msgstr "この文書用の.paperbackファイルが見つかりました。インポートしますか？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the dialog prompting to import a document's saved settings and bookmarks
msgid "Import document data"
msgstr "文書データのインポート"

#. TRANSLATORS: Error shown when the user dismisses the password prompt for an encrypted document without entering one
msgid "Password is required."
msgstr "パスワードが必要です。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announcement read by screen readers after following an internal link within the document
msgid "Navigated to internal link."
msgstr "リンク先へ移動しました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Default status bar text when no document is open
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "準備完了"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced after setting a temporary bookmark at the current position
msgid "Temporary bookmark set."
msgstr "一時しおりを設定しました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when jumping to a temporary bookmark but none has been set
msgid "No temporary bookmark."
msgstr "一時しおりがありません。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Fallback announcement when jumping to a temporary bookmark on a blank line
msgid "Temporary bookmark."
msgstr "一時しおり。"

msgid "Table View"
msgstr "テーブルビュー"

#. TRANSLATORS: Label for the password entry field in the "Document Password" prompt dialog
msgid "&Password:"
msgstr "パスワード(&P):"

